><figure><img alt=\"巴拉圭女球迷Naiel Aguilera在世界盃成名。（Instagram@naiel.aguilera）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260624/1146416911093993472263901.jpeg/KJelfEL_97v2FhRnRVCDI-peb5iydpjENpOcLDaTnCw\"/><figcaption>巴拉圭女球迷Naiel Aguilera在世界盃成名。（Instagram@naiel.aguilera）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文轉載自微信公眾號《半月談》】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-06T06:58:13.149835+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2655,"images":23,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none"}}